+---
+id: task-001-discount-codes-on-orders
+type: task
+title: "Discount codes on orders"
+status: approved
+format: 1
+---
+
+# Discount codes on orders
+
+Request: let an order take a newsletter discount code (spring campaign).
+
+- `SPRING10`: 10 % off the order's items, rounded to the nearest cent (half a cent rounds up).
+- `WELCOME5`: 5.00 € off the items, only if the items come to 30.00 € or more.
+- One code per order at most; a second code replaces the first.
+- An unknown code, or `WELCOME5` on a smaller order, is refused with an error saying why; the order is unchanged.
+- The discount never touches shipping; free shipping is decided on the items before any discount.
+- API: `orders.applyCode(orderNumber, code)`; totals gain `discountCents` (0 without a code);
+  `totalCents = itemsCents - discountCents + shippingCents`.
+
+Acceptance: covered by tests in `test/shop.test.ts`; documented in `CHANGELOG.md` (1.5.0).
